<title>USA: Mid Ocean Ltd Q1 net shr $1.43 vs $1.57.</title>
<headline>Mid Ocean Ltd Q1 net shr $1.43 vs $1.57.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
